THIRD_PARTY.md lists each with what it is used for and its copyright, and holds the license
texts that travel with the programs; every Cargo dependency carries its license text in its own
source.

Beside the programs, the release zips and the install hold Surge XT 1.3.4 (GPL-3.0-or-later),
the Surge Synth Team's synthesizer, as a separate CLAP plugin with its factory data, unchanged.
LICENSE-SURGE holds its notice and license; SOURCES.md in a release zip says where its complete
source is.

